p.src:
Freedom is described as a total negation of the observer: $\mathrm{Freedom}
\longleftrightarrow
\mathrm{Freedom\ from\ } O.$ Austerity does not produce this freedom as a method. The dialogue distinguishes dry, brittle austerity from inward austerity that belongs to freedom. The point is not self-denial as discipline; the point is the absence of the observer’s accumulation.

